  _glyph: "\U0001F33C\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Sleep forever
  _description: Scarlet poppies whose scent puts anyone who breathes it to sleep.
    The [[507cd04b-cb2f-4fbe-aa08-4037a1d120c8|Scarecrow]] and the [[5fa1b2c9-d6af-4624-a28a-bb96064706e6|Tin
    Woodman]] do not breathe, so they carry [[74be2f99-978f-4a21-9eca-fc675e81362d|Dorothy
    Gale]] out.
